              "content": "=You are a sales assistant. Here is a new lead:\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nMessage: {{ $json.Message }}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with these keys:\nscore (hot, warm or cold), reason (one sentence), email_subject, email_body (polite, under 80 words, no placeholders)."
            }
